        "title": "proposition + 吧",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Sentence-final 吧 can soften a guess and invite confirmation. A guess differs from the suggestion made by an action + 吧.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他是老师吧？",
                "pinyin": "tā shì lǎoshī ba ？",
                "meaning": "He is a teacher, I suppose?",
                "audio": "ab6a137bb08d7aa4e8c092ef0e93ea7261b4c16a52ca4c8fa3ef80fa2bf98368"
              },
              {
                "text": "你累了吧？",
